Package: tokens-go-brrr-gnome
Version: @VERSION@
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: tokens-go-brrr (= @VERSION@), gnome-shell
Maintainer: Fredrick Makoffu <42011427+fredrickmakoffu@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/fredrickmakoffu/cursor-spend-monitor
Description: GNOME Shell extension for tokens-go-brrr
 Shows AI coding usage limits as a status dot in the GNOME top bar. Log out and
 back in after installing so GNOME Shell loads the extension.
